#NEXUS

[ sellés2021a_fig3: Panel A of a time-calibrated troodontid tree with shaded subfamily boxes and geographic colour bars; 27 tips. The root is a 3-way node (Geminiraptor, Hesperornithoides, rest); Troodontinae has a 4-way node. Matrix spellings from the Hartman et al. matrix: IGM1001128, IGM100140, IGM10044, Troodon_sensu_lato, Urbacodon_mandibular_only. Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node (2026-10-29); topology only. ]

